{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267uB8xV0IMz1795512616.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>吳旭東（東東）今日（24日）於社交平台分享一輯與阮嘉敏（Mandy）合作拍攝《女神配對計劃2》「遊樂園篇」的幕後花絮照片，憑藉爆笑互動吸引大批網民關注。</p><p><p><img alt=\"wufelix_1206_1795506403_4037304947997026342_34022312627 (1).jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LS99agKd911795512575.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>相中阮嘉敏正靠在吳旭東的肩膊上熟睡，吳旭東見狀即趁機「偷拍」惡搞，毫無包袱地模仿身旁張開嘴巴熟睡的阮嘉敏，來一招「神同步」合拍，喜感十足。</p><p><p><img alt=\"wufelix_1206_1795506403_4037304929172953885_34022312627.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20261y6iKQBJVD1795512569.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>不少網民看後紛紛留言直呼他「太大膽居然敢影女神『黑圖』」、「小心Mandy醒返算帳」，亦有網民大讚兩人襯到絕，希望吳旭東多多分享與阮嘉敏的甜蜜日常。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"wufelix_1206_1795506403_4037304946730435526_34022312627.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026U2xfVYsCoG1795512563.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T10:23:59.688845+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T09:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T14:57:17.957591+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:17.164745+00:00","content_hash":"4819677b9799ece8f0218217db8f0dcbc430e8978b9a3ca5ffa70ce795cbbfbd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T10:23:59.688845+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}